# Text is stored LF and checked out however the contributor's platform wants it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The STEP reader and the Draco decoder ship as WebAssembly. Git detects that
# on its own, and this says so anyway: a line-ending normalisation applied to a
# .wasm does not fail, it produces a module that refuses to load.
*.wasm binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
